usage: run_svhn.py [-h] [--data-root DATA_ROOT] [--output-root OUTPUT_ROOT]
                   [--device {cuda,cuda:0}] [--download]
                   [--stop-after-epoch STOP_AFTER_EPOCH]
                   [--checkpoint CHECKPOINT]
                   {check,run,resume}

Five COMPLETE SVHN epochs using the supplied Any-Precision training function.
Production: CUDA, complete SVHN train ONLY, no extra, no MX, no early LR
decay. The 100-epoch protocol is fixed; this package stops no later than epoch
5.

positional arguments:
  {check,run,resume}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --data-root DATA_ROOT
  --output-root OUTPUT_ROOT
  --device {cuda,cuda:0}
  --download
  --stop-after-epoch STOP_AFTER_EPOCH
                        Absolute pilotgrens 1..5; verandert NIET het LR-
                        schema.
  --checkpoint CHECKPOINT
